**Format:** 5,400 µL product-stock concentrate + 24,600 µL ethanol 96% = 30.00 mL nominal EdP  
**Musk policy:** Romandolide is the sole functionally exact musk  

## Target Identity

The S35-R0 identity with a more believable pineapple flesh transition: less singular waxy-metallic ACP, more juicy ester contrast, no additional sweetness, and no change to the dry wood field.

## Functional Architecture

The fruit factor keeps product-stock volume and nominal active fruit ester equal to control: 800 µL ACP 10% becomes 700 µL ACP 10% plus 100 µL Hexyl Acetate 10%. The Hexyl stock carrier remains unspecified, so strict carrier-identity matching is HOLD.

